Dear {{issue.assignee.displayName}},

You are receiving this reminder because it's been 7 days since this ticket, <strong><a href="https://ford-advev.atlassian.net/browse/{{issue.key}}">{{issue.key}}</a></strong> - {{issue.summary}}, was assigned to you. 

If you are still attending to this ticket, please feel free to ignore this message. However, if you have completed your work or if the ticket needs attention from another team or individual, kindly update the ticket status or reassign it to the next stakeholder.

<strong>Here's a quick summary for your reference:</strong>

<strong>Created:</strong> {{issue.created.format("MM/dd/yyyy")}}
<strong>Status:</strong> {{issue.status.name}}
<strong>Priority:</strong> {{issue.priority.name}}
<strong>Due Date:</strong> {{issue.duedate.format("MM/dd/yyyy")}}
<strong>Description:</strong> {{issue.description}}
<strong>Comments:</strong> {{#issue.comments.last}} {{body}} - by {{author.displayName}} ({{created.format("dd/MM/yyyy")}}) {{/}}

Thanks,
<strong>Prototype Testing Team</strong>
Ford Advanced EV
